{"server":"tw","storyId":"main_11_level_st_11-03","groupId":"main_11","stageId":"st_11-03","title":"不可避免","storyCode":"11-21","avgTag":"幕間","sourcePath":"vendor/ArknightsGamedata/tw/gamedata/story/obt/main/level_st_11-03.txt","sourceHash":"2b7d26dbc483ccf6e36cb77d900cd1da334d20a04bafb4ac9c13d9547809c0d4","bodyAvailable":true,"blocks":[{"type":"background","backgroundId":"27_g6_hideout"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"推進之王","speakerId":"avg_npc_407_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"因陀羅","speakerId":"avg_155_tiger_1","isRemote":false,"text":"維娜！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"推進之王","speakerId":"avg_npc_407_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我睡著了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"摩根","speakerId":"avg_npc_405_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你受了不輕的傷，只暈了這麼一小會，已經很不錯了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"達格達","speakerId":"avg_npc_396_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......推進之王，自救軍來接應我們了。這裡還算安全，請好好休息。我們會守在你身側。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"推進之王","speakerId":"avg_npc_407_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯......"},{"type":"narration","text":"她的目光逐一掃過同伴們的面龐。\n所有人都和她一樣傷痕累累。可是至少......她們都還活著，眼睛裡也沒有失去希望。\n只有......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"推進之王","speakerId":"avg_npc_407_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......阿勒黛。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"克洛維希婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_401_1","isRemote":false,"text":"諸王長眠之所的門再度關上了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"克洛維希婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_401_1","isRemote":false,"text":"薩卡茲注意到了蒸汽騎士的聲音，一定也猜到了諸王之息已經離開原來的位置。他們在王宮周邊安排了更多人手。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"克洛維希婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_401_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我們的偵察兵想辦法靠近過入口，但並未發現阿勒黛的蹤跡。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"推進之王","speakerId":"avg_npc_407_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"克洛維希婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_401_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你想談談在下面發生的事嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"推進之王","speakerId":"avg_npc_407_1","isRemote":false,"text":"就跟戰士們想像中的一樣。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"推進之王","speakerId":"avg_npc_407_1","isRemote":false,"text":"阿勒黛·坎伯蘭為了救我們而犧牲了自己。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"克洛維希婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_401_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......唉。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"克洛維希婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_401_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這確實是阿勒黛會做的事。她是永遠高潔的坎伯蘭。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"推進之王","speakerId":"avg_npc_407_1","isRemote":false,"text":"坎伯蘭......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"推進之王","speakerId":"avg_npc_407_1","isRemote":false,"text":"沒有什麼永遠高潔的坎伯蘭，克洛維希婭。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"推進之王","speakerId":"avg_npc_407_1","isRemote":false,"text":"阿勒黛用生命保護了她想保護的東西。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"推進之王","speakerId":"avg_npc_407_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不是因為什麼使命......這只是阿勒黛自己的選擇。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"克洛維希婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_401_1","isRemote":false,"text":"自己的選擇......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"克洛維希婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_401_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯，她很勇敢。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"克洛維希婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_401_1","isRemote":false,"text":"可惜......我本想等阿勒黛回來之後，給她一個驚喜。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"推進之王","speakerId":"avg_npc_407_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這是......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"克洛維希婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_401_1","isRemote":false,"text":"公爵府已經成了一片廢墟。可前去打探情況的戰士們在灰燼中發現了它。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"推進之王","speakerId":"avg_npc_407_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......坎伯蘭家的蒸汽甲胄。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"32_i16"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"推進之王","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"原來......它並沒有被大火毀去。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"推進之王","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"哈哈。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"推進之王","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"要是......她也能看到就好了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"推進之王","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"那樣的話，她就會知道......並不是所有道路都是既定的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"推進之王","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"她曾經在這具甲胄上寄託的也並沒有被大火全部奪走。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"推進之王","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":null},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"推進之王","speakerId":"avg_npc_407_1","isRemote":false,"text":"克洛維希婭，我們在諸王長眠之所裡見到了蒸汽騎士。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"推進之王","speakerId":"avg_npc_407_1","isRemote":false,"text":"他可能是最後的蒸汽騎士了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"推進之王","speakerId":"avg_npc_407_1","isRemote":false,"text":"四年前，公爵的軍隊將蒸汽騎士引入諸王長眠之所，讓薩卡茲埋伏了他們。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"推進之王","speakerId":"avg_npc_407_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那個地下空洞......是蒸汽騎士的墳墓。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"克洛維希婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_401_1","isRemote":false,"text":"即便沒能親眼目睹，我也能想像出那場面有多慘烈。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"克洛維希婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_401_1","isRemote":false,"text":"他攻擊了你們，是嗎？他攻擊了......維多利亞的王儲。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"推進之王","speakerId":"avg_npc_407_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......他只是在繼續履行他的職責。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"推進之王","speakerId":"avg_npc_407_1","isRemote":false,"text":"他仍在守護諸王之息，即便在當年......這只是一個把全部蒸汽騎士騙進墳墓之中的藉口。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"克洛維希婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_401_1","isRemote":false,"text":"目睹著戰友們一個又一個遭到敵人的屠戮，又在黑暗中獨自堅持了這麼長時間，他可能已被痛苦折磨得神志不清。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"推進之王","speakerId":"avg_npc_407_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......不。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"推進之王","speakerId":"avg_npc_407_1","isRemote":false,"text":"如此......簡單的詞語無法形容這位戰士的心志。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"推進之王","speakerId":"avg_npc_407_1","isRemote":false,"text":"一邊是諸王的墓碑，一邊是戰友的屍首。他守著那片寂靜的墳墓，堅持了無數個日夜。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"推進之王","speakerId":"avg_npc_407_1","isRemote":false,"text":"他不是瘋子，不是幽靈，他的意志......甚至強大到了能夠擊退死亡。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"推進之王","speakerId":"avg_npc_407_1","isRemote":false,"text":"他憑著自己的意志，向背叛了他的維多利亞復仇。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"推進之王","speakerId":"avg_npc_407_1","isRemote":false,"text":"他同樣憑著自己的意志，守護著維多利亞的象徵。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"推進之王","speakerId":"avg_npc_407_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"推進之王","speakerId":"avg_npc_407_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我並不知道我們會不會再次見到他。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"推進之王","speakerId":"avg_npc_407_1","isRemote":false,"text":"如果......他能夠走出那片黑暗......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"推進之王","speakerId":"avg_npc_407_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我希望他能再一次找到......想要守護的東西。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"32_g1_lentiavenue"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"薩卡茲戰士","speakerId":"avg_npc_419_1","isRemote":false,"text":"將軍，海布里區的那群雇傭兵找到了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"曼弗雷德","speakerId":"avg_npc_404_1","isRemote":false,"text":"帶上來。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"薩卡茲戰士","speakerId":"avg_npc_419_1","isRemote":false,"text":"是，將軍。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"明椒","speakerId":"avg_4071_peper_1","isRemote":false,"text":"咳咳......咳咳咳，放、放開我！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"曼弗雷德","speakerId":"avg_npc_404_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"曼弗雷德","speakerId":"avg_npc_404_1","isRemote":false,"text":"一個......孩子。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"薩卡茲戰士","speakerId":"avg_npc_419_1","isRemote":false,"text":"將軍，她和其他幾個雇傭兵都是在海布里區的街邊找到的。他們都被不知道什麼人綁了起來。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"薩卡茲戰士","speakerId":"avg_npc_419_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我檢查過她的武器，她甚至沒怎麼跟人動手。她根本就不是個合格的雇傭兵。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"曼弗雷德","speakerId":"avg_npc_404_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......是這樣嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"明椒","speakerId":"avg_4071_peper_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"曼弗雷德","speakerId":"avg_npc_404_1","isRemote":false,"text":"說實話，雇傭兵。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"曼弗雷德","speakerId":"avg_npc_404_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你是不是沒有殺死任何一個維多利亞人？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"明椒","speakerId":"avg_4071_peper_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嗚......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"曼弗雷德","speakerId":"avg_npc_404_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你很怕我？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"明椒","speakerId":"avg_4071_peper_1","isRemote":false,"text":"沒、沒有！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"明椒","speakerId":"avg_4071_peper_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我是沒有完成任務，受罰也是應該的......你放過其他人！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"曼弗雷德","speakerId":"avg_npc_404_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"曼弗雷德","speakerId":"avg_npc_404_1","isRemote":false,"text":"帶回去。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"明椒","speakerId":"avg_4071_peper_1","isRemote":false,"text":"什......？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"薩卡茲戰士","speakerId":"avg_npc_419_1","isRemote":false,"text":"將軍......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"曼弗雷德","speakerId":"avg_npc_404_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......你也說了，她不是個合格的雇傭兵。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"曼弗雷德","speakerId":"avg_npc_404_1","isRemote":false,"text":"像她這樣的年輕薩卡茲......還不理解我們是在為何而戰，也不瞭解我們的敵人的真實面目。因為從來沒有人教過她。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"曼弗雷德","speakerId":"avg_npc_404_1","isRemote":false,"text":"而真正的戰爭......馬上就要開始了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"曼弗雷德","speakerId":"avg_npc_404_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我會讓她看清楚這場戰爭對薩卡茲的意義。她會在我身邊看清楚的。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"27_g7_subway"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"洛洛","speakerId":"avg_4040_rockr_1","isRemote":false,"text":"費斯特！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"費斯特","speakerId":"avg_4072_ironmn_1","isRemote":false,"text":"洛洛......哈哈，自救軍十一小隊又集合了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"洛洛","speakerId":"avg_4040_rockr_1","isRemote":false,"text":"說是又集合了，可十一小隊......不就只剩下我們兩個人。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"費斯特","speakerId":"avg_4072_ironmn_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......嗯。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"費斯特","speakerId":"avg_4072_ironmn_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不過，我相信很快我們的隊伍又會壯大起來的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"費斯特","speakerId":"avg_4072_ironmn_1","isRemote":false,"text":"畢竟......有博士和指揮官在呢。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"克洛維希婭，情況如何？","value":"1","blocks":[]},{"label":"克洛維希婭，自救軍還好嗎？","value":"2","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"克洛維希婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_401_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......撤退得還算及時，但傷亡依然很慘重。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"克洛維希婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_401_1","isRemote":false,"text":"還有......阿勒黛失蹤之後，自救軍還將面臨嚴峻的物資問題。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"克洛維希婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_401_1","isRemote":false,"text":"呼......要是有更多人手就好了......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"維多利亞雇傭兵","speakerId":"avg_npc_399_1","isRemote":false,"text":"把我們也算上吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"克洛維希婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_401_1","isRemote":false,"text":"鉛踝先生？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"鉛踝","speakerId":"avg_4062_totter_1","isRemote":false,"text":"雇主失蹤，合約作廢。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"克洛維希婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_401_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你們確定願意留下來嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"鉛踝","speakerId":"avg_4062_totter_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......來都來了。得罪了薩卡茲，要走也麻煩。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"鉛踝","speakerId":"avg_4062_totter_1","isRemote":false,"text":"而且，我們和達格達小姐她們在那個墓穴裡並肩作戰了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"鉛踝","speakerId":"avg_4062_totter_1","isRemote":false,"text":"沒有她們的話，我也未必能活著出來。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"鉛踝","speakerId":"avg_4062_totter_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我又欠下了一份人情......退休時間得推後了。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Misery","speakerId":"avg_npc_235","isRemote":false,"text":"......博士，我們也來了。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"你好，Misery。","value":"1","blocks":[]},{"label":"你依然很準時。","value":"2","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"號角","speakerId":"avg_npc_229_1","isRemote":false,"text":"抱歉，我們原本還可以行動得更快一些......這樣的話，說不定能在之前的指揮塔戰場上幫到您。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"克洛維希婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_401_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這位是......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"號角","speakerId":"avg_npc_229_1","isRemote":false,"text":"維多利亞風暴突擊隊第二分隊指揮官號角，向您報到。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"號角","speakerId":"avg_npc_229_1","isRemote":false,"text":"幾個小時前，Misery先生協助我們突襲了位於奧克特里格區和海布里區交界處的一處監獄。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"號角","speakerId":"avg_npc_229_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我們成功解救了一支不願為薩卡茲作戰的城防軍小隊。他們差一點就要被處決了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"號角","speakerId":"avg_npc_229_1","isRemote":false,"text":"日後我們將與羅德島和自救軍一起行動。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"克洛維希婭，看來我們有了一些新朋友。","value":"1","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"克洛維希婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_401_1","isRemote":false,"text":"感謝大家。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"克洛維希婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_401_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你們讓我驚喜，也讓我感到了許多可能性。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"克洛維希婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_401_1","isRemote":false,"text":"此外，雖然承受了不輕的損失，可我們依然成功取得了關於薩卡茲補給線的重要情報。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"費斯特","speakerId":"avg_4072_ironmn_1","isRemote":false,"text":"指揮官，博士，這是海布里區那幾個可能的停靠站的詳細資訊。我已經整理好了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"費斯特","speakerId":"avg_4072_ironmn_1","isRemote":false,"text":"再加上可露希爾小姐從城防軍指揮塔得到的資料......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"透過這些情報，我們就能找到這條補給線。","value":"1","blocks":[]},{"label":"我們的下一步行動目標就藏在這些資訊中。","value":"2","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"克洛維希婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_401_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯，博士。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"克洛維希婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_401_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我們會做好準備，去迎接下一場戰鬥。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"27_g6_hideout"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"推進之王","speakerId":"avg_npc_407_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"推進之王","speakerId":"avg_npc_407_1","isRemote":false,"text":"諸王之息。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"推進之王","speakerId":"avg_npc_407_1","isRemote":false,"text":"高文，我知道你在。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"推進之王","speakerId":"avg_npc_407_1","isRemote":false,"text":"出來。"},{"type":"narration","text":"她的身邊仍空無一人。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"推進之王","speakerId":"avg_npc_407_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......使命。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"推進之王","speakerId":"avg_npc_407_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你陪伴我至今，為我選擇的使命是什麼？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"推進之王","speakerId":"avg_npc_407_1","isRemote":false,"text":"再度成為維多利亞的王嗎？"},{"type":"narration","text":"沉默。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"推進之王","speakerId":"avg_npc_407_1","isRemote":false,"text":"阿勒黛......她把蒸汽騎士作為自己的理想，然而......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"推進之王","speakerId":"avg_npc_407_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我們並不總知道自己在走向哪裡。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"推進之王","speakerId":"avg_npc_407_1","isRemote":false,"text":"若有一天——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"推進之王","speakerId":"avg_npc_407_1","isRemote":false,"text":"若有一天，我並未隨著你為我選擇的使命前行。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"推進之王","speakerId":"avg_npc_407_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......你也會成為我的夢魘嗎？"},{"type":"narration","text":"空曠的地下結構中，只落下了一聲輕輕的歎息。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_towerinside"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿斯卡綸","speakerId":"avg_npc_395_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"阿斯卡綸。","value":"1","blocks":[]},{"label":"你好，阿斯卡綸。","value":"2","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿斯卡綸","speakerId":"avg_npc_395_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"凱爾希的傷怎麼樣？","value":"1","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿斯卡綸","speakerId":"avg_npc_395_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......很嚴重。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿斯卡綸","speakerId":"avg_npc_395_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但是有閃靈在。她會恢復。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿斯卡綸","speakerId":"avg_npc_395_1","isRemote":false,"text":"如果我和女妖之王能趕上的話......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"擊退血魔大君已是大功一件。","value":"1","blocks":[]},{"label":"這不怪你們。","value":"2","blocks":[]},{"label":"靠你們拖住了那個“紅眼病”，我們才能撤退。","value":"3","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿斯卡綸","speakerId":"avg_npc_395_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"阿米婭......","value":"1","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿斯卡綸","speakerId":"avg_npc_395_1","isRemote":false,"text":"她在恢復。你也能看出來，她不會放任自己昏睡太久。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"我沒能看到她看見的。","value":"1","blocks":[]},{"label":"我總是不能陪著她經歷一切。","value":"2","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿斯卡綸","speakerId":"avg_npc_395_1","isRemote":false,"text":"無論是哪個你，都很關心阿米婭。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"我一直沒來得及問你。","value":"1","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"你也曾懷疑我假裝失憶嗎？","value":"1","blocks":[]},{"label":"你信任我嗎，阿斯卡綸？","value":"2","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿斯卡綸","speakerId":"avg_npc_395_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我的匕首會替我回答。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿斯卡綸","speakerId":"avg_npc_395_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......在必要的時候。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"我想知道四年前的真相。","value":"1","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿斯卡綸","speakerId":"avg_npc_395_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"我問過凱爾希。","value":"1","blocks":[]},{"label":"我問過阿米婭。","value":"2","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"但我不知道什麼才是真的。","value":"1","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿斯卡綸","speakerId":"avg_npc_395_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"我以前沒什麼機會與你交談。","value":"1","blocks":[]},{"label":"你總是很沉默。","value":"2","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"能否告訴我，你看見了什麼？","value":"1","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿斯卡綸","speakerId":"avg_npc_395_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......四年前，你命我離開本艦，執行一項任務。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿斯卡綸","speakerId":"avg_npc_395_1","isRemote":false,"text":"當我趕回來的時候，殿下已經離開我們。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"當時羅德島怎麼樣了？","value":"1","blocks":[{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿斯卡綸","speakerId":"avg_npc_395_1","isRemote":false,"text":"羅德島必須在特雷西斯的大軍圍上來之前逃出去。"}]},{"label":"阿米婭呢？","value":"2","blocks":[{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿斯卡綸","speakerId":"avg_npc_395_1","isRemote":false,"text":"阿米婭剛剛繼承魔王的力量，陷入了長時間的昏迷。"}]}]},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"凱爾希呢？","value":"1","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿斯卡綸","speakerId":"avg_npc_395_1","isRemote":false,"text":"她要救羅德島，救阿米婭，還要救你。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"救我？","value":"1","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿斯卡綸","speakerId":"avg_npc_395_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿斯卡綸","speakerId":"avg_npc_395_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這是殿下的最後一道命令。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"......","value":"1","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_394_1","isRemote":false,"text":"博士......博士......Dr.{@nickname}......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"阿米婭......","value":"1","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"我在這裡。","value":"1","blocks":[]},{"label":"我不會離開你。","value":"2","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"narration","text":"阿米婭下意識抓住了你的衣角，又一點點鬆開了。\n大顆大顆的淚滴從她的眼睛裡湧出來。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_394_1","isRemote":false,"text":"特蕾西婭小姐......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_394_1","isRemote":false,"text":"她讓我聽見了......薩卡茲眾魂的聲音。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_394_1","isRemote":false,"text":"他們要向傷害薩卡茲的所有人復仇，他們要向......凱爾希醫生復仇。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"凱爾希？","value":"1","blocks":[]},{"label":"這與她有什麼關係？","value":"2","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_394_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......博士，我相信自己感受到的一切都是真實的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_394_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我記得羅德島上的很多個夜晚，凱爾希醫生與特蕾西婭小姐的促膝長談。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_394_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我記得凱爾希醫生為了救治一群薩卡茲感染者，連續一周不眠不休。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_394_1","isRemote":false,"text":"然而......她也確實在兩百年前那樣傷害過薩卡茲......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_394_1","isRemote":false,"text":"凱爾希醫生一定早就給過特蕾西婭小姐她當時為何要這麼做的答案。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_394_1","isRemote":false,"text":"特蕾西婭小姐也一定理解了，所以她們才能成為親密無間的朋友。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_394_1","isRemote":false,"text":"可是，即便是我......即便我那麼熟悉凱爾希醫生......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_394_1","isRemote":false,"text":"在感受到關於那場戰爭的回憶的時候，我依然感到了憤怒與悲哀。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_394_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_394_1","isRemote":false,"text":"或許這就是特蕾西婭小姐想告訴我的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_394_1","isRemote":false,"text":"特蕾西婭小姐想告訴我，她為何與薩卡茲眾魂站在一起。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_394_1","isRemote":false,"text":"此時此刻，他們就在......整個倫蒂尼姆的頭頂。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"......","value":"1","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"narration","text":"你注意到了雷聲的迫近。\n就在窗外，就在頭頂，跟著你們寸步不離。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"真正的戰爭就要來了。","value":"1","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"narration","text":"你握緊了阿米婭的手。\n你們一起望向天空。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"32_i14_1"},{"type":"narration","text":"轟隆。轟隆。轟隆。\n不止倫蒂尼姆，就連周邊的城市都感受到了劇烈的震動。\n前所未見的龐然巨物自陰雲之中升起。\n在它身後，碎片大廈頂部的厚重雲層終於裂開了小小的一角。抬著頭的人們直到此刻才意識到，籠罩著倫蒂尼姆的並不是尋常的陰雲。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"32_i14_2"},{"type":"narration","text":"那是天災雲，從未出現在任何天災信使記錄中的巨大天災雲。\n濃黑色的雲層因為積攢了過多能量而迸發著火花，從而形成了近似於雷聲的轟鳴。\n而形狀怪異的飛行器就像這場風暴的眼睛。"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"32_i14_2"},{"type":"narration","text":"在它的注視下，所有薩卡茲的敵人都將無路可逃。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":null},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"avg_ep11"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":null},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"21_G7_decisivebattlealley_d"},{"type":"narration","text":"2:28 P.M. 天氣/陰\n維多利亞千貿城"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"風笛","speakerId":"avg_222_bpipe_1","isRemote":false,"text":"陳陳！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陳","speakerId":"avg_npc_662_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"風笛","speakerId":"avg_222_bpipe_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你在發什麼呆呀？休斯在等著我們了，聽他的語氣，他剛剛可是得到了一個很有用的消息啊！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陳","speakerId":"avg_npc_662_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿赫茉妮","speakerId":"avg_npc_228_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陳","speakerId":"avg_npc_662_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那個從休斯家裡走出來的人......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"風笛","speakerId":"avg_222_bpipe_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這街上好多人呢，你說的是哪一個呀？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陳","speakerId":"avg_npc_662_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那個綠頭髮的菲林。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陳","speakerId":"avg_npc_662_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我似乎在哪裡見過她。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"風笛","speakerId":"avg_222_bpipe_1","isRemote":false,"text":"噢......你記人臉的能力總是比我好。從休斯家出來的話，是去找他談生意的吧？會不會是前幾天在車站見過？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陳","speakerId":"avg_npc_662_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......不是。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陳","speakerId":"avg_npc_662_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這張臉......出現在很多年前。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"風笛","speakerId":"avg_222_bpipe_1","isRemote":false,"text":"欸欸，該不會是什麼你在龍門抓過的罪犯吧？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陳","speakerId":"avg_npc_662_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那我就不可能忘記了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陳","speakerId":"avg_npc_662_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陳","speakerId":"avg_npc_662_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不琢磨了，大不了待會問問休斯。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿赫茉妮","speakerId":"avg_npc_228_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......風笛。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿赫茉妮","speakerId":"avg_npc_228_1","isRemote":false,"text":"另一個......也在情報裡見過。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿赫茉妮","speakerId":"avg_npc_228_1","isRemote":false,"text":"呵呵......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿赫茉妮","speakerId":"avg_npc_228_1","isRemote":false,"text":"差一點就能來一場感人肺腑的校友聚會了啊。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"21_G9_rhodes_xqoffice"},{"type":"narration","text":"維多利亞南部辦事處"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"葦草","speakerId":"avg_226_weed_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......你好。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"羅德島幹員","speakerId":"char_016_medic","isRemote":false,"text":"欸？你是那個......我之前在本艦醫療艙見過你。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"葦草","speakerId":"avg_226_weed_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我想......麻煩你一件事。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"葦草","speakerId":"avg_226_weed_1","isRemote":false,"text":"請把這封信交給凱爾希醫生和Dr.{@nickname}。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"羅德島幹員","speakerId":"char_016_medic","isRemote":false,"text":"你......咳咳，你是打算離開辦事處？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"羅德島幹員","speakerId":"char_016_medic","isRemote":false,"text":"想走的話，你可以和其他撤離的幹員一樣提交一下申請，方便人事部瞭解情況......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"葦草","speakerId":"avg_226_weed_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......他們知道。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"葦草","speakerId":"avg_226_weed_1","isRemote":false,"text":"他們知道......我有必須面對的人和事。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"葦草","speakerId":"avg_226_weed_1","isRemote":false,"text":"而我繼續留在這裡的話，只會給所有人帶來危險。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"羅德島幹員","speakerId":"char_016_medic","isRemote":false,"text":"你想保護羅德島？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"葦草","speakerId":"avg_226_weed_1","isRemote":false,"text":"羅德島......是個很安靜的地方。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"葦草","speakerId":"avg_226_weed_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我很喜歡這裡，也很感激你們，尤其是那位......已經離去的薩科塔。你們給了我過去一直渴求的平靜。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"葦草","speakerId":"avg_226_weed_1","isRemote":false,"text":"而現在，我想將這份平靜回饋給你們。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"葦草","speakerId":"avg_226_weed_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我已經做好了準備。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"27_g11_lentinobleroom_indoor"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"維多利亞軍官","speakerId":"avg_npc_408_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......薩卡茲的飛空艇已在倫蒂尼姆城內升空。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"維多利亞軍官","speakerId":"avg_npc_408_1","isRemote":false,"text":"此外，坎伯蘭公爵的繼承人失蹤了。開斯特公爵並未得到諸王之息。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"維多利亞軍官","speakerId":"avg_npc_408_1","isRemote":false,"text":"短短一天之內，有十餘名信使造訪您的領地。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"維多利亞軍官","speakerId":"avg_npc_408_1","isRemote":false,"text":"他們都想知道，您是否準備見他們了，公爵大人。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"威靈頓公爵","speakerId":"avg_npc_652_1","isRemote":false,"text":"——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"威靈頓公爵","speakerId":"avg_npc_652_1","isRemote":false,"text":"您怎麼看，愛布拉娜殿下？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":"avg_npc_236","isRemote":false,"text":"......公爵閣下。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":"avg_npc_236","isRemote":false,"text":"我看到......屬於塔拉的新時代近在眼前。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":null}],"observedOperators":[{"speakerId":"char_016_medic","aliases":["羅德島幹員"]}]}
